+const PATCH_TOOL_SYSTEM_GUIDANCE: &str = "When editing files, call the provided apply_patch structured function tool directly. Do not invoke apply_patch through exec_command, shell_command, PowerShell, cmd.exe, Bash, or another command wrapper. Use command tools only for inspection, builds, tests, and commands that are not file edits.";
